	)
	(text "Open a block for its sheet. Sheets meet through global labels and named power rails.\nSolid boxes: one board or assembly. Dashed: planned, or going (its parts DNP). Wires turn at 45 degrees.\nGathered from the code and docs (2026-10-16): notebooks/pinout.md, micropython/nodes, klipper/*.cfg,\nprojects/limn/content/electronics.md, docs/block-diagrams.md, docs/load-cell.md. Missing details: marked \"to fill in\"."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
